---
title: Sequence — Execute Suite & Generate Report
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User (CLI/Web)
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant WS as WebSocketHub
    participant Disp as SuiteDispatcher
    participant K8s as ContainerDeploy<br/>(Docker/K8s)
    participant ApiR as APIRunner
    participant UiR as UIRunner
    participant PerfR as PerfRunner
    participant Col as ResultCollector
    participant Flake as Retry/FlakeManager
    participant Rep as ReportGenerator
    participant LLM as ModelAPIConnector
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant KB as KBOrchestrator
    participant Obs as Observability

    User->>API: POST /runs {plan_id, env, suites}
    API->>DB: insert run(status=queued)
    API->>Disp: dispatch(run_id, suites)
    API-->>User: 202 {run_id}
    User->>WS: subscribe(run_id)

    Disp->>K8s: provision workers (api·ui·perf pools)
    K8s-->>Disp: ready

    par API run
        Disp->>ApiR: execute(api_tests, fixtures)
        ApiR->>Obs: emit spans
        ApiR-->>Col: JUnit XML + logs
    and UI run
        Disp->>UiR: execute(ui_tests, seed)
        UiR->>Obs: traces + screenshots/video
        UiR-->>Col: Allure results + artifacts
    and Perf run
        Disp->>PerfR: execute(k6_scripts, dataset)
        PerfR->>Obs: metrics stream
        PerfR-->>Col: k6 summary + time series
    end

    loop while running
        Col->>WS: progress events
        WS-->>User: live updates
    end

    Col->>Flake: identify flaky failures
    Flake->>ApiR: retry(failed, n=2)
    Flake->>UiR: retry(failed, n=2)
    Flake-->>Col: final results

    Col->>DB: persist(results, artifacts_refs)
    Col->>Rep: build_report(run_id)
    Rep->>DB: load run + history
    Rep->>LLM: summarize failures · cluster root causes
    LLM-->>Rep: narrative + clusters
    Rep->>Rep: render HTML/PDF/JSON · trends · coverage
    Rep->>DB: persist(report_ref)
    Rep-->>WS: run.completed
    WS-->>User: report ready

    Rep--)KB: feedback: failure patterns
    KB->>KB: upsert(test outcomes -> KB)
